WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.010
That's the ocean. I didn't
even know it was there.

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:04.230
Where'd you come from, ocean?

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:06.783
Where you been all my life, girl please.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.590
I've been doing challenges
for my body, heart, mind,

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:14.150
and soul, and we're at
the fourth episode, y'all.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.010
I'm gonna be going on the
ultimate self-care experience.

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.500
That means I'm gonna be going someplace

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.000
where I've never been before,
I'm gonna be eating alone,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.110
I'm gonna be staying by
myself, and I'm just gonna be

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:25.890
using this time to reflect on
everything that I've learned

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.690
in the first three episodes
with my body, heart, and mind.

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.750
I'm hoping that by the end of this weekend

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:35.160
I am feeling calm, collected,
less anxious, less of a mess,

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.633
and ready to arrive at my 30th birthday.

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:41.040
Good morning.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.140
Okay, so I just finished brunch by myself,

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.670
and I think I was really nervous at first,

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:49.070
but then like I don't know,
time by yourself is so valuable.

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:50.850
And I think we forget that.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:52.580
I think as women we've been socialized

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.980
to be super accommodating.
When there was no one

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:56.440
to like ask how they were feeling

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:59.540
and if everything was okay, except myself,

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:02.200
I felt this deep part of me just relax.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.420
The day so far has been pretty good.

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.470
I've just been doing
everything that I want to do,

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:07.890
for once, which is really nice.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:09.930
This fortune teller set up shop

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:12.220
in this cute house on the pier.

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:13.960
She's like, as your
approaching this new chapter

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.450
in your life, you need to
learn how to receive more.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:18.700
Because that's the good part of life.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.040
You know you're working really
hard, and you're making sure

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.250
that you're there for your friends.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:23.880
I don't like it when people give me gifts

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:24.950
or pay me compliments.

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:27.260
You're not gonna be able
to know your self-worth

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:29.090
until you learn how to do this.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:31.410
I kinda needed to hear that today.

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:33.530
There's this thought: "Should I go out?

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:36.220
Should I go to a bar?" My soul said, "No."

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:38.500
I just really want to chill.

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:42.550
I'm doing a face mask.
This is Olay's Fresh Reset.

00:01:42.550 --> 00:01:45.670
When I'm on vacation, either
with my family or my boyfriend,

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:48.520
I feel like I have to kind
of like utilize every second,

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:50.980
go out every night, and do all the events.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:53.210
I have to be honest with
you: Like if I truly ask

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:55.623
what I want right now, it's just rest.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.510
At the end of all these challenges,

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:01.860
and as I transition to
my 30th year of life,

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:05.460
I can honestly say that
I feel better turning 30

00:02:05.460 --> 00:02:07.610
than I did when I was 21.

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:10.110
I highly recommend setting
aside some time where you can

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.550
take a look at your body,
mind, heart, and soul.

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:15.100
Set some intentions, set
some challenges for yourself,

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:17.710
just so you can kind of go
into your next year of life

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:19.270
or go into this next milestone

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:21.460
feeling prepared and feeling ready.

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:23.750
You know, everything happens for a reason,

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.490
and I'm here for a reason.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.490
I think I'm in the right spot right now.

